{"id":"so_lido","lemma":"sólido","pos":"adj","rank":3808,"glosses":["solid","strong, firm"],"ipa":"/ˈsolido/","forms":{"feminine":"sólida","masculinePlural":"sólidos","femininePlural":"sólidas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-s%C3%B3lido.wav","examples":[{"text":"El hielo es sólido.","en":"Ice is solid.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636648","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"ice"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Era de un rojo sólido.","en":"It was solid red.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442809","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"red"},null]},{"text":"¿Está la viga sólida o hueca?","en":"Is the beam solid or hollow?","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"timber"},null,{"g":"or"},{"g":"hollow, empty","l":"hueco"}]},{"text":"La leche se congeló y se puso sólida.","en":"The milk froze and became solid.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/684447","words":[null,null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to freeze","l":"congelar"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to put, to place","l":"poner"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"amazing, very good"]]},{"text":"El amor de una hermana está entre los más sólidos de todos.","en":"Sisterly love is among the strongest of all.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"love"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"sister"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"between"},null,null,null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"all","l":"todo"}],"phrases":[[7,9,"most"]]}]}